       "            rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LogisticRegression.html#:~:text=n_iter_,-ndarray%20of%20shape%20%281%2C%20%29\">\n",
